{"seq":3,"slug":"health-score-redyellow-green","title":"库存健康度评分与红黄绿灯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/inventory-health-metric/health-score-redyellow-green","wordCount":1869,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"库存健康度评分与红黄绿灯\">库存健康度评分与红黄绿灯</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前两篇给出了原始指标——DIO、库龄分布、ABC-XYZ 象限——但运营团队不可能每天看 30 个指标列。<strong>健康度评分的作用是把多维信号压缩成一个可排序、可分派、可追踪的标量</strong>，让「哪个仓哪个品类最需要干预」在一页内可读。评分不是精确科学，它是注意力调度器；它的成功标准是「人按分数排优先级去做事，事后证明排序是对的」。</p>\n<p>评分设计的第一原则是<strong>可解释性优先于拟合度</strong>。一个用 XGBoost 训出来的黑箱分数即使排序更准，也无法回答「这个仓为什么掉到黄灯」，运营不会信它，也不会照它行动。可解释评分的标准形式是<strong>加权求和 + 分档映射 + 扣分项</strong>，每个分量都能回溯到一个明细报表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>权重示例</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>周转</td>\n<td>DIO 相对目标倍数</td>\n<td>越低越好</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td><a href=\"age-bucket-dio-turnover\">库龄分布与 DIO</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库龄结构</td>\n<td>90 天以上库龄金额占比</td>\n<td>越低越好</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>批次库龄表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>呆滞</td>\n<td>呆滞 SKU 金额占比</td>\n<td>越低越好</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td><a href=\"../obsolete-excess-detect/slowmoving-deadstock-rule-alert\">呆滞识别规则</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务</td>\n<td>可售率 / 缺货 SKU 占比</td>\n<td>越高越好</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td><a href=\"../obsolete-excess-detect/safety-stock-excess-stockout\">缺货超储并存诊断</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资金</td>\n<td>单仓库存金额超预算幅度</td>\n<td>越低越好</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td><a href=\"../capital-attribution/inventory-carrying-cost-capital\">资金占用</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据质量</td>\n<td>账面与实物差异率</td>\n<td>越低越好</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>循环盘点结果</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始指标] --&gt; B[归一化&lt;br/&gt;对比目标值]&#10;  B --&gt; C[加权求和&lt;br/&gt;得分 0-100]&#10;  C --&gt; D[分档映射]&#10;  D --&gt; E{分数区间}&#10;  E --&gt;|&gt;=80| F[绿灯&lt;br/&gt;常规监控]&#10;  E --&gt;|60-79| G[黄灯&lt;br/&gt;进入改善清单]&#10;  E --&gt;|&lt;60| H[红灯&lt;br/&gt;强制干预 + 责任人]&#10;  I[一票否决项] --&gt; D&#10;  J[扣分项&lt;br/&gt;如盘点差异超限] --&gt; D\">graph TD\n  A[原始指标] --&gt; B[归一化&lt;br/&gt;对比目标值]\n  B --&gt; C[加权求和&lt;br/&gt;得分 0-100]\n  C --&gt; D[分档映射]\n  D --&gt; E{分数区间}\n  E --&gt;|&gt;=80| F[绿灯&lt;br/&gt;常规监控]\n  E --&gt;|60-79| G[黄灯&lt;br/&gt;进入改善清单]\n  E --&gt;|&lt;60| H[红灯&lt;br/&gt;强制干预 + 责任人]\n  I[一票否决项] --&gt; D\n  J[扣分项&lt;br/&gt;如盘点差异超限] --&gt; D</pre><h2 id=\"归一化-把异构指标放到同一把尺子上\">归一化：把异构指标放到同一把尺子上</h2><h3 id=\"目标比值法\">目标比值法</h3><p>最稳的归一化方式是把每项指标表示成<strong>达成率</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>score</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>target</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mtext>actual</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}_i = \\min(1, \\text{target}_i / \\text{actual}_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">target</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">actual</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 用于「越低越好」的指标。这比 z-score 更适合运营场景，因为 z-score 的「平均水平」会随大盘漂移，且对异常值敏感。目标比值法的缺点是目标值需要逐品类设定——这正是 <a href=\"abc-xyz-classification\">ABC-XYZ 分类</a> 的用武之地：AX 象限可以用更严格的目标，CZ 象限可以放宽。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分布位置法\">分布位置法</h3><p>当目标值难以设定时（如新品类没有历史基线），用<strong>同品类同期分位</strong>替代：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>score</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>percentile</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}_i = 1 - \\text{percentile}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">percentile</span></span></span></span></span></span>。这方法自校准、无需人工设目标，但会制造「相对排名稳定」的假象——全品类都在恶化时，中位数附近的 SKU 分数不会掉。解法是把分位法与绝对阈值结合：分位法决定相对排序，绝对阈值决定红黄绿灯，两者分工明确。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分段线性映射优于线性\">分段线性映射优于线性</h3><p>库存指标与「业务可接受度」的关系通常是非线性的。DIO 从 30 天涨到 45 天可能只是淡季，从 90 天涨到 120 天却是灾难。因此归一化应使用<strong>分段线性</strong>：在目标值附近给宽松斜率，在警戒区给陡峭斜率。这实际上是把专家判断编码进映射函数，比让权重承担全部调节更直观。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分档与红黄绿灯阈值\">分档与红黄绿灯阈值</h2><h3 id=\"阈值必须有业务含义\">阈值必须有业务含义</h3><p>「80 分是绿灯」这句话如果没有业务含义，就是拍脑袋。绿灯应定义为<strong>不需要额外动作的状态</strong>：库存金额在预算内、无超期库龄、无破线缺货。黄灯应定义为<strong>需要列入改善清单但不必紧急干预</strong>。红灯应定义为<strong>需要指定责任人在一个周期内出方案</strong>。这决定了阈值的实际位置——它由「改善清单能承载多少条目」倒推，而不是由分数分布倒推。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一票否决与扣分项\">一票否决与扣分项</h3><p>纯加权求和有个致命缺陷：一个仓的呆滞金额占比 40%（本应红灯），但周转和服务两项表现极佳，加权后可能仍是黄灯甚至绿灯。这对呆滞治理是灾难。解法是引入<strong>一票否决项</strong>（veto）：任何一项触发硬约束，直接封顶。典型的一票否决项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>90 天以上库龄金额占比 &gt; 30%</li>\n<li>呆滞 SKU 金额占比 &gt; 25%</li>\n<li>账面实物差异率 &gt; 2%</li>\n<li>单仓库存金额超预算 20% 以上</li>\n</ul>\n<p>扣分项与一票否决不同：扣分项是<strong>减分不清零</strong>，用于惩罚可容忍但不理想的状态，如「盘点完成率低于计划」「预警超期未处理」这类流程健康度问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;score_version&quot;: &quot;2026.09&quot;,&#10;  &quot;granularity&quot;: &quot;warehouse_x_category&quot;,&#10;  &quot;weights&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;dio_ratio&quot;: 0.25,&#10;    &quot;aged_90d_share&quot;: 0.2,&#10;    &quot;deadstock_share&quot;: 0.2,&#10;    &quot;instock_rate&quot;: 0.15,&#10;    &quot;capital_vs_budget&quot;: 0.1,&#10;    &quot;record_accuracy&quot;: 0.1&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;normalization&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;dio_ratio&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;method&quot;: &quot;target_ratio&quot;,&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;linear&quot;,&#10;      &quot;breaks&quot;: [&#10;        [0.8, 1.0],&#10;        [1.5, 0.2]&#10;      ]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;aged_90d_share&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;method&quot;: &quot;piecewise&quot;,&#10;      &quot;breaks&quot;: [&#10;        [0.1, 1.0],&#10;        [0.3, 0.0]&#10;      ]&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;veto&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;aged_90d_share&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;gt&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 0.3, &quot;cap_score&quot;: 55 },&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;deadstock_share&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;gt&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 0.25, &quot;cap_score&quot;: 55 },&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;record_accuracy_delta&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;gt&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 0.02, &quot;cap_score&quot;: 59 }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;deductions&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;alert_overdue_count&quot;, &quot;per_unit&quot;: 2, &quot;max&quot;: 15 },&#10;    { &quot;field&quot;: &quot;cycle_count_plan_completion&quot;, &quot;op&quot;: &quot;lt&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 0.9, &quot;penalty&quot;: 5 }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;bands&quot;: { &quot;green&quot;: 80, &quot;yellow&quot;: 60, &quot;red&quot;: 0 }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"score_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026.09\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"granularity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"warehouse_x_category\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"weights\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dio_ratio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"aged_90d_share\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#0