-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"penalty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"bands\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"green\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"yellow\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"red\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"评分的粒度与下钻\">评分的粒度与下钻</h2><h3 id=\"三层粒度\">三层粒度</h3><p>评分必须在三个粒度上一致：<strong>仓 × 品类</strong>（调度层，决定谁进改善清单）、<strong>品类</strong>（品类经理视角）、<strong>SKU</strong>（执行层，决定具体动作）。三层不是简单聚合：仓级评分高但可能由某个品类拖累，SKU 级评分低但金额微不足道。工程上要求<strong>每一层都能一键下钻到下一层，且下钻后分数能解释上一层的下降来源</strong>（贡献度分解）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"贡献度分解\">贡献度分解</h3><p>加权求和的副产品是贡献度：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta = w_i \\cdot (s_i^{now} - s_i^{prev})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0087em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0592em;vertical-align:-0.2769em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，按降序排列就是「这个仓掉 8 分主要是谁造成的」。贡献度分解是把评分从「打分工具」升级成「归因工具」的关键，也是 <a href=\"../capital-attribution/slowmove-attribution-selection-price\">滞销归因</a> 在评分层的对应物。</p>\n<h3 id=\"评分的时效性\">评分的时效性</h3><p>库存评分用日粒度数据算会噪声过大（周末出库少，DIO 假性上升）。标准做法是<strong>滚动窗口 + 平滑</strong>：指标用 7 日或 28 日滚动窗口计算，评分按周发布，日粒度只用于红灯的即时告警。这套节奏要在评分定义里写死，否则「为什么昨天的分数和今天差这么多」会成为每周例会的第一问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与改善闭环的衔接\">与改善闭环的衔接</h2><p>评分本身不产生价值，<strong>它进入改善循环才产生价值</strong>。可以把评分映射到 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DMAIC\">DMAIC</a> 的节奏上：DMAIC 被定义为「a data-driven improvement cycle used for optimizing and stabilizing business processes and designs」，五步「proceed in the given order」，其中 Measure 阶段的要求是「Good data is at the heart of the DMAIC process」，Control 阶段则要「embed the changes and ensure sustainability」。</p>\n<p>映射关系是：评分的红灯清单 = Define（问题界定与排序）；指标明细与库龄表 = Measure；贡献度分解 = Analyze；<a href=\"../recommendation-dashboard/transfer-promotion-markdown-suggest\">调拨/促销/清仓建议</a> = Improve；把改善后的分数固化进下一次基线 = Control。缺少 Control 环节的评分体系会退化成「每月打分、每月遗忘」的仪式。</p>\n<p>目标设定则建议遵循 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SMART_criteria\">SMART criteria</a>：该来源列出的五要素中，Measurable 是「Quantifying, or at least suggesting, an indicator of progress」，Assignable 是「Defining responsibility clearly」，Time-related 是「Including a timeline for expected results」。库存改善目标天生容易违反 Assignable——分数涨了但没人负责——所以红灯必须带责任人与时限，见 <a href=\"../recommendation-dashboard/inventory-alert-owner-workflow\">库存预警推送与责任人闭环</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>评分是注意力调度器，可解释性优先于拟合精度；标准形式是加权求和 + 分档 + 一票否决 + 扣分项。</li>\n<li>归一化用目标比值法或同品类分位法，分段线性映射把专家判断编码进函数。</li>\n<li>红黄绿灯阈值从「改善清单能承载多少条目」倒推，而非从分数分布倒推。</li>\n<li>一票否决防止呆滞被高周转掩盖，扣分项覆盖流程健康度。</li>\n<li>评分需在仓×品类、品类、SKU 三层一致，且支持贡献度分解下钻。</li>\n<li>评分进入 DMAIC 循环才有价值，红灯清单必须带责任人（Assignable）与时限（Time-related）。</li>\n<li>下一步是把红灯拆成可执行动作，见 <a href=\"../recommendation-dashboard/transfer-promotion-markdown-suggest\">调拨/促销/清仓建议</a> 与 <a href=\"../recommendation-dashboard/inventory-health-category-dashboard\">品类/仓库健康看板</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"库存健康度评分与红黄绿灯","id":"库存健康度评分与红黄绿灯"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"归一化：把异构指标放到同一把尺子上","id":"归一化-把异构指标放到同一把尺子上"},{"level":3,"text":"目标比值法","id":"目标比值法"},{"level":3,"text":"分布位置法","id":"分布位置法"},{"level":3,"text":"分段线性映射优于线性","id":"分段线性映射优于线性"},{"level":2,"text":"分档与红黄绿灯阈值","id":"分档与红黄绿灯阈值"},{"level":3,"text":"阈值必须有业务含义","id":"阈值必须有业务含义"},{"level":3,"text":"一票否决与扣分项","id":"一票否决与扣分项"},{"level":2,"text":"评分的粒度与下钻","id":"评分的粒度与下钻"},{"level":3,"text":"三层粒度","id":"三层粒度"},{"level":3,"text":"贡献度分解","id":"贡献度分解"},{"level":3,"text":"评分的时效性","id":"评分的时效性"},{"level":2,"text":"与改善闭环的衔接","id":"与改善闭环的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ABC-XYZ 价值×波动分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/inventory-health-metric/abc-xyz-classification"},"next":{"title":"呆滞/死库存识别规则与预警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/inventory-health-obsolete-diagnosis/obsolete-excess-detect/slowmoving-deadstock-rule-alert"}}